<p>@ FDEPS is calculated assuming a 10 percent hike in freight. The % chg in this FDEPS for a further increase of 2 percent (12 percent in all) is indicated in the next column. Freight refers to both rail and road freight here. We assume that road freight rates will also be hiked by a similar percentage as the rail freight hike.</p>
